              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika walenga mutanda aitulwila ulunweno lwakwe pa mumana ukalamba wa Yufurate. Awe amenshi mu mumana yakama, pakupekanya umwakupita ishamfumu sha ku kabanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo namona imipashi yakowela itatu iyapala bacula, ilefuma mu kanwa ka cisoka na mu kanwa ka ciswango na mu kanwa kakwa kasesema wabufi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyi mipashi yakowela yena ilacita ifishibilo fyacipeshamano. Kabili iya ku shamfumu shonse isha pesonde lyonse, kukushilonganika ku bulwi bwa pali bulya bushiku bwakwa Lesa wa maka yonse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bulya bushiku bwakwa Lesa:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Calola mukuti ubushiku Lesa akaputula imilandu ya bantu bonse.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
