              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo kwaba no kubyata kwa myele ya nkuba, calabulukuta, no kupanta kwa mfula, elyo ne cinkukuma icikalamba. Apo Lesa abumbile icalo, takwatala akuba icinkukuma ica musango uyu. Ici cali e cinkukuma icabipisha pali fyonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
